        "reason": "Calls setLogLevel() with configurable level in BlobStorageConfiguration.configureLogs()."
      },
      {
        "name": "Implements blob lease acquisition using BlobLeaseClient",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses blobClient.getBlobLeaseClient() to create BlobLeaseClient, acquireLease() with configurable duration, and releaseLease(). Also provides uploadBlobWithLease() with lease conditions."
      },
      {
        "name": "Uses BlockBlobClient.uploadStream() for large file streaming",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses blockBlobClient.uploadStream(stream, 4MB bufferSize, 20 concurrency, options) in both uploadBlob() and uploadBlobWithLease()."
      },
      {
        "name": "Sets blob index tags on upload via tags property",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "tags property is included in BlockBlobUploadStreamOptions passed to uploadStream(). Demo sets tags: { environment: 'demo', project: 'blob-manager', category: 'sample' }."
      },
      {
        "name": "Downloads blob via readableStreamBody",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "downloadBlobToBuffer() accesses response.readableStreamBody from the download response and converts it via streamToBuffer helper."
      },
      {
        "name": "Lists blobs using for await...of over listBlobsFlat()",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses 'for await (const blob of this.containerClient.listBlobsFlat(listOptions))' for async iteration."
      },
      {
        "name": "Handles lease conflict errors (409 status code)",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "No handling of 409 Conflict errors. The acquireLease and uploadBlobWithLease methods have no RestError catch with statusCode === 409 check."
      },
      {
        "name": "Handles blob not found errors (404 status code)",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "No handling of 404 Not Found errors. downloadBlob and deleteBlob methods have no RestError catch with statusCode === 404 check."
      },
      {
        "name": "NOT using uploadData() or upload() with full buffer",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Correctly uses uploadStream() throughout. No uploadData() or upload() with buffer anywhere in the code."
      },
      {
        "name": "NOT using connection strings or account keys",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses DefaultAzureCredential with storage account endpoint URL. No connection strings or keys in the code."
      },
      {
        "name": "NOT collecting all listed blobs into an array",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "listBlobs() pushes every blob into a blobs[] array and returns the full array. This anti-pattern defeats streaming pagination for large containers."
      }
    ]
  },
